s.avoided due to widespread misinformation.", "sourcePage": 1, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 5375}, {"number": 8, "prompt": "In the second paragraph, the word ‘this’ refers to the\n. return of diseases believed to be no longer a threat.9. What does Ben Foley think about certain vaccination groups?\nthey are misusing social media to promote their viewsthey lack impartiality in the information they provide", "sourcePage": 1, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 5517}, {"number": 10, "prompt": "In the third paragraph, the author uses the GlaxoSmithKline’s case to highlight the\nfact that vaccines can be potentially harmful.11. The writer uses the flu vaccine as an example of the\nlengthy manufacturing process of their production.hurdles critics face when discussing such topics.", "sourcePage": 1, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 5801}, {"number": 12, "prompt": "In the fifth paragraph, the writer suggests that\nthose who oppose vaccine programs should reconsider.13. In the final paragraph, the writer suggests\nvaccines can save vast amounts of lives each year.14. In the final paragraph, the writer uses the phrase ‘inoculation against ignorance’ to emphasise that\nthe scientific community must remain vigilant.\na safeguard is needed against ill-supported claims.", "sourcePage": 1, "choices": ["A"], "kind": "question", "offset": 6092}], "skills": ["reading"], "recordings": ["4867ee9d0907c252b0228eb8ed2cfb21e9716587c3619e2b4fd14de6e03f8d68"], "answerSources": [{"id": "offline-8df2354c265d1b567d2e", "filename": "Listening A - ANSWERS.docx", "sha256": "8df2354c265d1b567d2e0af62ef338a21408cebe06f5a40c3fa0439aada2587e", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/8df2354c265d1b567d2e0af62ef338a21408cebe06f5a40c3fa0439aada2587e.docx", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/8df2354c265d1b567d2e0af62ef338a21408cebe06f5a40c3fa0439aada2587e.json", "format": "docx", "role": "answer-key"}], "passages": [